# Endpoint Concept

Definition:

Endpoints show which Pods are connected to a Service.

Check:

```bash
kubectl get endpoints
```

Example:

```text
nginx   10.42.2.40:80
```

Meaning:

```text
Service
   |
   V
Pod
```

