# Service Types

ClusterIP

Definition:
Accessible only inside cluster.

Command:

```bash
kubectl expose deployment nginx --port=80
```

---

NodePort

Definition:
Accessible outside cluster using NodeIP and Port.

Command:

```bash
kubectl expose deployment nginx --type=NodePort --port=80
```

Access:

```text
http://NodeIP:NodePort
```

---

LoadBalancer

Definition:
Accessible outside cluster using External IP.

Command:

```bash
kubectl expose deployment nginx --type=LoadBalancer --port=80
```

Access:

```text
http://192.168.218.241
```

